{"3996910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TomaDO!", "steam_appid": 3996910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning:</strong> We are not responsible for broken mice, gamepads, or monitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TomaDO!</strong> is a fast, physics‑driven platformer where tomato heroes sprint, jump, and recover through colorful obstacle courses. Every run mixes precise timing, momentum control, and quick resets with checkpoints and water respawns, making each attempt feel fresh and rewarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996910/extras/c07d49fa3b3f33b3ded631fc8e37ec3a.poster.avif?t=1771871355\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996910/extras/c07d49fa3b3f33b3ded631fc8e37ec3a.webm?t=1771871355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996910/extras/c07d49fa3b3f33b3ded631fc8e37ec3a.mp4?t=1771871355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Parkour Chaos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiplayer races with host-created lobbies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Jump pads, moving platforms, drop traps, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Teleporters and checkpoint respawns keep the pace fast</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Smooth, comfortable third-person camera that follows your character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996910/extras/91812b363c543fe7dd4cb1627f6f2dc9.poster.avif?t=1771871355\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996910/extras/91812b363c543fe7dd4cb1627f6f2dc9.webm?t=1771871355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996910/extras/91812b363c543fe7dd4cb1627f6f2dc9.mp4?t=1771871355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-Golf Zones</strong> (Yes, Really)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some areas turn the game into mini-golf:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Charge your shot power and launch the ball</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use a trajectory preview to plan your move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bounce off walls for stylish trick shots</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Aim for clean runs or embrace the chaos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996910/extras/2203d9940b3fe3b592c08290bf64256a.poster.avif?t=1771871355\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996910/extras/2203d9940b3fe3b592c08290bf64256a.webm?t=1771871355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996910/extras/2203d9940b3fe3b592c08290bf64256a.mp4?t=1771871355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for Quick Sessions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump in, play</strong> a few rounds, and laugh at the inevitable slips. Whether you’re chasing clean finishes or ridiculous ricochets, <strong>TomaDO!</strong> is all about momentum, timing, and a little tomato madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More Tomato Madness Ahead</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TomaDO! is just getting started. We’re actively prototyping new game modes and fresh course ideas to expand the chaos beyond parkour and mini-golf. Wishlist the game to follow updates and upcoming announcements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the demo during Steam Next Fest and wishlist the full game to follow updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning:</strong> We are not responsible for broken mice, gamepads, or monitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TomaDO!</strong> is a fast, physics‑driven platformer where tomato heroes sprint, jump, and recover through colorful obstacle courses. Every run mixes precise timing, momentum control, and quick resets with checkpoints and water respawns, making each attempt feel fresh and rewarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996910/extras/c07d49fa3b3f33b3ded631fc8e37ec3a.poster.avif?t=1771871355\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996910/extras/c07d49fa3b3f33b3ded631fc8e37ec3a.webm?t=1771871355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996910/extras/c07d49fa3b3f33b3ded631fc8e37ec3a.mp4?t=1771871355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Parkour Chaos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiplayer races with host-created lobbies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Jump pads, moving platforms, drop traps, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Teleporters and checkpoint respawns keep the pace fast</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Smooth, comfortable third-person camera that follows your character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996910/extras/91812b363c543fe7dd4cb1627f6f2dc9.poster.avif?t=1771871355\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996910/extras/91812b363c543fe7dd4cb1627f6f2dc9.webm?t=1771871355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996910/extras/91812b363c543fe7dd4cb1627f6f2dc9.mp4?t=1771871355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-Golf Zones</strong> (Yes, Really)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some areas turn the game into mini-golf:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Charge your shot power and launch the ball</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use a trajectory preview to plan your move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bounce off walls for stylish trick shots</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Aim for clean runs or embrace the chaos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996910/extras/2203d9940b3fe3b592c08290bf64256a.poster.avif?t=1771871355\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996910/extras/2203d9940b3fe3b592c08290bf64256a.webm?t=1771871355\" type